<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Most Hungary state securities yield seen up.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Most Hungary state securities yield seen up.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian one- and three-month discount treasury bill yields were seen dropping at this week's auctions, a poll of four dealers showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Dealers were divided over how two-year government bond yields would change this week.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) will auction one-month treasury bills  HTBM on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday and two-year 1998/K government bonds on Thursday. @</p>
